Review these previously model-flagged conflict pairs against the supplied quotations and scope/date fields. Do not assume every pair is a conflict. Different products, origins, tariff programs, or dated stages are not automatically contradictory. Only use apparent_same_scope_conflict when the supplied claims appear incompatible on the same scope/date; otherwise distinguish dated progression, differing scope, complementary claims, and missing scope. Do not verify current law from memory. Explain the reason briefly for every pair.
UNTRUSTED_EVIDENCE_JSON:
{"research_date": "2026-09-10", "pairs": [{"pair_id": "conflict_5a366395a7365815d6914f16", "claim_ids": ["claim_769d671f6e84b0b830a9ceb3", "claim_cdc9295633ceba6c0ceee781"], "query_ids": ["q_81"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_769d671f6e84b0b830a9ceb3", "quote": "The proclamation specifies that the applicable rates of duty for articles imported from the United Kingdom will remain at 25% ad valorem.", "url": "https://taxnews.ey.com/news/2025-1192-us-increases-import-tariffs-of-aluminum-and-steel", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"exporting_country": "United Kingdom", "duty_rate": "25% ad valorem"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_cdc9295633ceba6c0ceee781", "quote": "According to the executive order signed by President Trump on February 10, this tariff will apply uniformly to all countries, with no exceptions or exemptions.", "url": "https://aslgate.com/the-united-states-officially-imposes-import-tariffs-on-aluminum-and-steel-products", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"legal_authority": "executive order signed by President Trump on February 10"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_04ecbe6bcf9a6b53b04dea6c", "claim_ids": ["claim_161644d98e6121c518dc8d8b", "claim_164429ec7e4b7ff5ec97fa40"], "query_ids": ["q_82"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_161644d98e6121c518dc8d8b", "quote": "the applicable rates of duty for articles of the United Kingdom that would otherwise be applicable pursuant to Proclamation 9704, as amended; Proclamation 9705, as amended; Proclamation 9980, as amended; Proclamation 10895; and Proclamation 10896 shall remain at 25 percent ad valorem.", "url": "https://www.whitehouse.gov/presidential-actions/2025/06/adjusting-imports-of-aluminum-and-steel-into-the-united-states", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Proclamation 9704, as amended; Proclamation 9705, as amended; Proclamation 9980, as amended; Proclamation 10895; and Proclamation 10896", "duty_rate": "25 percent ad valorem", "effective_date": "On or after July 9, 2025"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_164429ec7e4b7ff5ec97fa40", "quote": "As set forth in Annexes I and II to this proclamation, as of 12:01 a.m. eastern daylight time on June 4, 2025, the tariffs proclaimed by Proclamation 9704, as amended; Proclamation 9705, as amended; Proclamation 9980, as amended; Proclamation 10895; and Proclamation 10896 are modified to increase the respective tariff rates from an additional 25 percent ad valorem to an additional 50 percent ad valorem.", "url": "https://www.whitehouse.gov/presidential-actions/2025/06/adjusting-imports-of-aluminum-and-steel-into-the-united-states", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"duty_rate": "additional 50 percent ad valorem", "effective_date": "June 4, 2025"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_9da9f196b29984de7f309533", "claim_ids": ["claim_3446c50f50d2d3cc80e01893", "claim_4212e18dc1988d69740d04e0"], "query_ids": ["q_82"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_3446c50f50d2d3cc80e01893", "quote": "Imports of aluminum articles and derivative aluminum articles from Argentina, Australia, Canada, Mexico, EU countries, and the UK shall be subject to the revised tariff rate of 25 percent ad valorem established in clause 2 of this proclamation, commensurate with the tariff rate imposed on such articles imported from most other countries.", "url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2025/02/18/2025-02832/adjusting-imports-of-aluminum-into-the-united-states", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"affected_product": "aluminum articles and derivative aluminum articles", "duty_rate": "25 percent ad valorem"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_4212e18dc1988d69740d04e0", "quote": "Accordingly, I have determined that it is necessary and appropriate to increase the tariff rate for imports of steel articles and derivative steel articles, and aluminum articles and derivative aluminum articles, from 25 percent ad valorem to 50 percent ad valorem effective as of 12:01 a.m. eastern daylight time on June 4, 2025.", "url": "https://www.whitehouse.gov/presidential-actions/2025/06/adjusting-imports-of-aluminum-and-steel-into-the-united-states", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Proclamation 10896 and Proclamation 10895", "affected_product": "steel articles and derivative steel articles, and aluminum articles and derivative aluminum articles", "effective_date": "June 4, 2025"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_c74bfca0b93f2a860fefa3f0", "claim_ids": ["claim_5de78d2e940aef418e6b379a", "claim_7845524f854d53d688ea804c"], "query_ids": ["q_82"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_5de78d2e940aef418e6b379a", "quote": "The proclamation specifies that the applicable rates of duty for articles imported from the United Kingdom will remain at 25% ad valorem.", "url": "https://www.ey.com/en_gl/technical/tax-alerts/us-increases-import-tariffs-of-aluminum-and-steel", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "25% ad valorem"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_7845524f854d53d688ea804c", "quote": "Effective 4 June 2025, the proclamation increases the tariff rate for imports of steel articles and derivative steel articles, as well as aluminum articles and derivative aluminum articles, from 25% ad valorem to 50% ad valorem.", "url": "https://www.ey.com/en_gl/technical/tax-alerts/us-increases-import-tariffs-of-aluminum-and-steel", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"affected_product": "steel articles and derivative steel articles, as well as aluminum articles and derivative aluminum articles", "effective_date": "4 June 2025"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_7f28c9cdd9c245cce32095c1", "claim_ids": ["claim_3ce9f49a778dd0cb66faa193", "claim_9c989617417531bc5d6a2d41"], "query_ids": ["q_83"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_3ce9f49a778dd0cb66faa193", "quote": "All tariffs imposed on products under the steel, aluminum, and copper Section 232 actions will now apply to the full customs value of the imported product, including derivative products.", "url": "https://www.whitecase.com/insight-alert/united-states-modifies-steel-aluminum-and-copper-section-232-tariffs", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_9c989617417531bc5d6a2d41", "quote": "The previous system in which the tariffs on derivative products were calculated by splitting the customs value between steel, aluminum, copper, and non-metal content has been eliminated.", "url": "https://www.whitecase.com/insight-alert/united-states-modifies-steel-aluminum-and-copper-section-232-tariffs", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"affected_product": "derivative products"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_2f0a36fb369e051e7139628a", "claim_ids": ["claim_355166ea3e1ac780c3f726fe", "claim_fab56ed4f0d735bba76e45a6"], "query_ids": ["q_84"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_355166ea3e1ac780c3f726fe", "quote": "Shortly after returning to the presidency in 2025, President Trump invoked Section 232 to levy duties on two key metals: in February, his administration imposed 25% tariffs on both steel and aluminum.", "url": "https://www.z2data.com/insights/why-you-need-supply-chain-visibility-for-section-232", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232", "affected_product": "steel and aluminum", "duty_rate": "25%"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_fab56ed4f0d735bba76e45a6", "quote": "Several months later, in June 2025, Trump doubled these Section 232 tariffs to 50%.", "url": "https://www.z2data.com/insights/why-you-need-supply-chain-visibility-for-section-232", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232", "duty_rate": "50%", "effective_date": "June 2025"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_f05256a1548b8980901579ac", "claim_ids": ["claim_7cf7d0e48ad02b1855273f25", "claim_a6a34bba39cd83bcca54031a"], "query_ids": ["q_84"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_7cf7d0e48ad02b1855273f25", "quote": "Goods qualifying for USMCA treatment are excluded effective March 7, 2025", "url": "https://www.internationaltradeinsights.com/2025/08/summary-of-tariff-requirements-updated-august-4-2025", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232 Auto & Auto Parts Duties and IEEPA Tariffs (Canada & Mexico)", "effective_date": "March 7, 2025"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_a6a34bba39cd83bcca54031a", "quote": "Tariffs were paused until March 4, 2025 and went into effect on March 4, 2025", "url": "https://www.internationaltradeinsights.com/2025/08/summary-of-tariff-requirements-updated-august-4-2025", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232 Auto & Auto Parts Duties and IEEPA Tariffs (Canada & Mexico)", "duty_rate": "25%", "effective_date": "March 4, 2025"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_85bd6daffdffe502eefd978c", "claim_ids": ["claim_197d39f2f4ff022f1e1bacea", "claim_8d79d7215b49c1ede80c7543"], "query_ids": ["q_88"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_197d39f2f4ff022f1e1bacea", "quote": "Effective with respect to goods entered for consumption, or withdrawn from warehouse for consumption, on or after 12:01 a.m. eastern daylight time on July 1, 2025, subchapter III of chapter 99 of the HTSUS is modified:", "url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2025/08/19/2025-15819/adoption-and-procedures-of-the-section-232-steel-and-aluminum-tariff-inclusions-process", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"tariff_program": "subchapter III of chapter 99 of the HTSUS", "effective_date": "July 1, 2025"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_8d79d7215b49c1ede80c7543", "quote": "Steel and aluminum derivatives added to the annex in this notice: The duties set out in the annex for these additional steel and aluminum derivatives are effective with respect to certain products that are entered for consumption, or withdrawn from warehouse for consumption, on or after 12:01 a.m. Eastern Time on August 18, 2025.", "url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2025/08/19/2025-15819/adoption-and-procedures-of-the-section-232-steel-and-aluminum-tariff-inclusions-process", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232", "effective_date": "August 18, 2025"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_92b71889d6c68a6698dc5333", "claim_ids": ["claim_197d39f2f4ff022f1e1bacea", "claim_e12441afd63836746a0ee6b1"], "query_ids": ["q_88"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_197d39f2f4ff022f1e1bacea", "quote": "Effective with respect to goods entered for consumption, or withdrawn from warehouse for consumption, on or after 12:01 a.m. eastern daylight time on July 1, 2025, subchapter III of chapter 99 of the HTSUS is modified:", "url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2025/08/19/2025-15819/adoption-and-procedures-of-the-section-232-steel-and-aluminum-tariff-inclusions-process", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"tariff_program": "subchapter III of chapter 99 of the HTSUS", "effective_date": "July 1, 2025"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_e12441afd63836746a0ee6b1", "quote": "A. Effective with respect to goods entered for consumption, or withdrawn from warehouse for consumption, on or after 12:01 a.m. on August 18, 2025, subchapter III of chapter 99 of the Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the United States (HTSUS) is modified", "url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2025/08/19/2025-15819/adoption-and-procedures-of-the-section-232-steel-and-aluminum-tariff-inclusions-process", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"effective_date": "August 18, 2025"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_b136a17266a48a6749b11dc6", "claim_ids": ["claim_1071e9dcccfa690c9bc94a0e", "claim_151c0d9ebc4e330522a9bd08"], "query_ids": ["q_89"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_1071e9dcccfa690c9bc94a0e", "quote": "On April 30, 2025, BIS publicized a rule implementing the resulting Section 232 Inclusions Process. Submissions are accepted in two-week windows three times per year.", "url": "https://www.bis.gov/about-bis/bis-leadership-and-offices/SIES/section-232-investigations/section-232-steel-aluminum", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232 Inclusions Process", "legal_authority": "rule implementing the resulting Section 232 Inclusions Process"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_151c0d9ebc4e330522a9bd08", "quote": "Pursuant to Presidential Proclamations 10895 and 10896 of February 10, 2025, Commerce is no longer processing Section 232 Exclusion Requests effective 11:59 PM ET on February 10, 2025, and is no longer accepting or issuing exclusions from the Section 232 Steel and Aluminum Tariffs.", "url": "https://www.bis.gov/about-bis/bis-leadership-and-offices/SIES/section-232-investigations/section-232-steel-aluminum", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232 Steel and Aluminum Tariffs", "legal_authority": "Presidential Proclamations 10895 and 10896 of February 10, 2025", "reported_policy_status": "no longer processing Section 232 Exclusion Requests"}}]}]}
